            "review_title": "Review at Lau De Bau Sen",
            "review_text": "Drifter\nPhong Nha-Ke Bang National Park, Vietnam4619 contributions\n0\njust a local joint\nNov 2015 • Couples\nWas surfing for goat meat resturants and came upon this one reviewed nicely by many here on TA. Great little local place with good food and fine service. Grilled goat, grilled prawns and ca keo fish all were deliscious. Nominal price for fresh local food. Highly recommend it for the brave at heart as its off the beaten track.\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten November 23, 2015",
